From: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:59:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] [ROCm][Inkling2] Inkling-2-Mini (inkling2_loop) on RDNA4
 and CDNA

- amd/loop.py: Inkling2LoopModel / Inkling2LoopForConditionalGeneration
  ported from upstream vllm/models/inkling2/nvidia/loop.py (PR #69028,
  Apache-2.0): message controllers, stacked controller weights, pass
  restart from the prelude state, bank of the previous pass blocks.
  Runs the unfused per-layer path on AMD.
- amd/model.py: _make_layer hook, per-pass conv states, 3-input local
  layers, gfx12 MoE selection (upstream Inkling2MoE stays on gfx950 MXFP8),
  arch gate relaxed to gfx950 or gfx12, and --cpu-offload-gb support via
  the upstream offloader (wrap_modules, as make_layers does).
- __init__.py: the AMD module map resolves the loop architecture.

Signed-off-by: AEON-7 <aeon-7@users.noreply.github.com>
